anation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n특성 방정식이 으로 표현되는\n\n시스템이 과제동이기 위한 의 값은?\n\n\n① 150         ② 100\n\n③ 60          ④ 50\n\n⑤ 36","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m41-q.webp","width":678,"height":567},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m41-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n다음과 같은 형 회로에서 , , 일 때,\n\n임피던스 정수의 값으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① ,    ② , \n③ ,    ④ , \n⑤ , ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m42-q.webp","width":678,"height":759},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m42-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공